   8  arg: 92-U-235(N,ABS),,ETA

---Input:
   Reaction:  ['92-U-235(N,ABS),,ETA']
   xn:        x1
   x1range:   None - 4.0
   x2range:   None - None
   x3range:   None - None
   fx:        1
   fy:        1
   xrange:    None
   Output:    eta1
   x4ei:       and x1<=4.0

