Summary of Reaction-Codes 1
----1.
    fullCode       92-U-235(N,ABS),,ETA
    ReactionType   ETA        Neutron yield (Eta)
    WebQuantity1   NU         Fission neutron multiplicities
    nx             1          Number of x (independent variables)
    y     c5data   PRD/REAC   Data: data                           ///products/reaction
    x1    EN       EV         Incident energy: energy              ///electron-Volts
/Summary of Reaction-Codes
Summary of Units 2
---basicUnits:PRD/REAC    category:MLT
